    "text": "Columbia\nCoroner identifies infant who died after being found in Columbia hotel room\n14 hours ago\nCOLUMBIA, S.C. — Investigators with the Richland County Sheriff's Department (RCSD) are looking into the death of an infant who was found at a local hotel. The sheriff's department was contacted around 7 a.m. Tuesday, August 19, by a local hospital after EMS transported an infant from the Days Inn at 1144 Bush River Road. The child was pronounced dead at the hospital.\n54",
